  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "About us [GGIS]\r\nWe are researchers & investigators of Ghostly Ground
    Investigation Studios, also known as GGIS. We explore and research abandoned
    structures and locations to search and find their deepest, darkest secrets. We\u2019ve
    explored and searched locations like (blank) and found out about a lot of weird
    stuff that has happened in this location. This includes both old and new crimes,
    abnormalities within the location, such as ghosts haunting the location and more.
    Other than that, we\u2019ve also explored Bubble Gubbies Aquarium, and we wish
    to share our experiences and information about this location. \r\n \r\nOur team
    mainly consists of researchers. We also have 2 explorers, who stay in the abandoned
    locations throughout the span of a few days and nights, and me, the blog writer
    and media manager. If you have any recommendations of locations you\u2019d like
    us to visit, send an email to [Email] or leave a comment to show your support.\r\n
    \r\nDonations are also very welcome, as it helps us keep our sites and blogs
    up and going."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
